  "ingredients": [
    "5 pounds red potatoes, cut into chunks",
    "3 cubes chicken bouillon",
    "1 tablespoon minced garlic, or to taste",
    "1 (8 ounce) container sour cream",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7LBk_MikvVhZmw3FHYbTcLjVgvs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-5154-4x3-step-01-7f68e6b0ad1741da98c19fd8f5591ea6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25895/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes, bouillon, and garlic in a large pot and cover with water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wNSN4X4UzA1MpzQynCvnjuumOpU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-5160-4x3-step-02-995e70d0f3f343729cc3047ffe256403.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25895/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain in a colander over a large bowl, reserving cooking water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TpkmyPJvl0BPr3ljI3EbWlnWjKs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-5171-4x3-step-03-cc5b4c802c92449697751fc7ccdd74cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25895/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash potatoes with sour cream and cream cheese until smooth and creamy, adding a little reserved water if needed to reach desired consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uApW-UhrMzC8BVq_skafiP7OfKk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-5174-4x3-step-04-19246973a7fc49808a495a90b021ea21.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25895/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mashed potato mixture to a slow cooker, cover, and cook on Low for 2 to 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k_fX2i_CMO7JiXitAFK0YAV-pWc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-5175-4x3-step-05-1b23b6feae384eb3b7600c72b125ed53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25895/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, stir in butter and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JkI1rPRS3kuxGM1YOqx_K5KC0LQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-5172-4x3-step-06-4dce8c8c55a042dbbbd74b654a01491b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25895/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NG4IEEop3Tgl1fA3QECD0BFOMis=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25895-slow-cooker-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-0092-4x3-9c2d475cfd4245f6bc37b689ab2880b6.jpg"
